            <documentation id="sid-cc11b847-1be7-4c2a-8f99-e4c19dbef49b">IM classifies the physical out-of-scope part for the original Reject return. Set route=Rejected, intakeOutcome=Rejected and physicalHandoverRequired=true. T4 retains the original Reject database entry, same-day physical return, IO special shipping label, standard explanation and required dispatch documents. Do not create shipping documents or return the part in T1.</documentation>
