      <subProcess completionQuantity="1" id="FFR_e4db280d45805632b73ed0f0bb3c5826" isForCompensation="false" name="T2 | Select / verify route [R4 R5]" startQuantity="1" triggeredByEvent="false">
         <documentation id="sid-40d670d0-b62a-4a47-a480-8b96a583796d">T2 | R4/R5 | I-03. Search and reserve, locate and physically verify, then confirm part/location/reservation before any courier booking or shipping ticket. Preserve reservation integrity until actual T4 handover. A shelf miss opens the IO-owned discrepancy and follows the interstate recovery route; ordinary no-spare cases retain Parts Type List and technician/priority decisions. Outputs: route=Spare, Interstate or Internal. Controlled manual evidence and IO reconciliation cover capture failure. Booking, labels, dispatch windows and all physical handovers are executed once in T4; no dispatch is claimed here.</documentation>
         <extensionElements>
            <signavio:signavioMetaData metaKey="bgcolor" metaValue="#eaf5fc"/>
            <signavio:signavioMetaData metaKey="bordercolor" metaValue="#176490"/>
            <signavio:signavioLabel bold="" fill="" fontFamily="" fontSize="12.0" italic="" ref="text_name"/>
            <signavio:signavioDiagramMetaData metaKey="revisionid" metaValue="6f66fd50365a4e48b56b6e86faf48c79"/>
