      <subProcess completionQuantity="1" id="FFR_1c5bd209d935565895d080561a3132e1" isForCompensation="false" name="T3 | Repair and test part [R3, R4]" startQuantity="1" triggeredByEvent="false">
         <documentation id="sid-a7710fa1-dd58-4a57-8190-df2e0812a0f4">TO-BE per internally repaired request. R3 / I-02: triage and resource optimisation reuse sufficient diagnostic evidence after Senior review; full diagnostics remain when evidence is incomplete or unsuitable. Required rig tests and the one-time rebuild/retest remain. R4 / I-03: automation and resource optimisation capture repair completion, part ID, tray location, actor and time at the point of work. The completing role owns capture; controlled manual evidence and an IO-owned reconciliation exception cover capture failure. Repair complete/ready for dispatch is distinct from actual dispatch. The request continues to the applicable 3 PM dispatch window. Report sections 6 and 9; case pp.4-6. No improved failure rate is assumed.</documentation>
         <extensionElements>
            <signavio:signavioMetaData metaKey="bgcolor" metaValue="#eaf5fc"/>
            <signavio:signavioMetaData metaKey="bordercolor" metaValue="#176490"/>
            <signavio:signavioLabel bold="" fill="" fontFamily="" fontSize="12.0" italic="" ref="text_name"/>
            <signavio:signavioDiagramMetaData metaKey="revisionid" metaValue="fa3926ebce6d445fb6eca13742c1ffca"/>
         </extensionElements>
