         <textAnnotation id="FFR_76e981d3aaef5ee6aed9b67413bb274f" signavio:alignment="left">
            <extensionElements>
               <signavio:signavioMetaData metaKey="bgcolor" metaValue="#ffffff"/>
               <signavio:signavioMetaData metaKey="bordercolor" metaValue="#000000"/>
            </extensionElements>
            <text>R3 / I-02 | Triage; resource optimisation. Senior reviews evidence, then selects targeted work or full diagnostics. Required rig testing and one rebuild/retest remain; no improved failure rate assumed.</text>
         </textAnnotation>
         <textAnnotation id="TB_R4_RepairCaptureAnnotation" signavio:alignment="left" textFormat="text/plain">
            <extensionElements>
               <signavio:signavioMetaData metaKey="bgcolor" metaValue="#eaf5fc"/>
               <signavio:signavioMetaData metaKey="bordercolor" metaValue="#176490"/>
            </extensionElements>
            <text>R4 / I-03 | Automation; resource optimisation. Completing role captures ID, tray, repair completion, actor and time. Failed capture uses controlled manual evidence and IO reconciliation. Repair complete is not dispatched.</text>
         </textAnnotation>
      </subProcess>
      <subProcess completionQuantity="1" id="FFR_c102b5e9226d510bad741b5b3cbb1c83" isForCompensation="false" name="T5 | Record and track returned part [R2 R4]" startQuantity="1" triggeredByEvent="false">
         <documentation id="sid-bb1d8193-76e8-4b67-97a4-f677edceafda">[R2; T5] For each previous-day return, retain serial/advice checks and first receipt capture. Verify required return fields once, reuse that verified operational record for the mandatory audit/training output, and verify delivery. IO owns repair/retry or controlled manual output. Never create a second operational receipt to fix output delivery. Audit permissions, provenance and reconciliation remain required.

[R2, R4; T5] Retain historical serial-to-ID lookup, legitimate new-ID creation and technician confirmation. Replace handwritten ID notes with a digital identity/history link and tracked technician quality follow-up. Capture/device/label failure uses a controlled manual record and later digital reconciliation, owned by IO.</documentation>
         <extensionElements>
            <signavio:signavioMetaData metaKey="bgcolor" metaValue="#eaf5fc"/>
            <signavio:signavioMetaData metaKey="bordercolor" metaValue="#176490"/>
            <signavio:signavioLabel bold="" fill="" fontFamily="" fontSize="12.0" italic="" ref="text_name"/>
            <signavio:signavioDiagramMetaData metaKey="revisionid" metaValue="51ebd590d30e43fdb932a4628fe9fb14"/>
         </extensionElements>
         <incoming>TB_F_SG_MoreReturns_FFR_c102b5e9226d510bad741b5b3cbb1c83</incoming>
         <outgoing>TB_F_FFR_c102b5e9226d510bad741b5b3cbb1c83_SG_MoreReturns</outgoing>
