         <documentation id="sid-2d2f80a4-2f24-488f-b07b-23f6ed897bfc">[R4; T6] The four original daily physical controls and their sequence remain unchanged until pilot evidence supports reducing them. Review stale states and physical/digital mismatches alongside those checks. IO creates or updates tracked discrepancy/recovery cases; the daily routine need not wait for multi-day recovery closure.</documentation>
