         <task completionQuantity="1" id="TB_NextNotice" isForCompensation="false" name="Advance only notified items next notice date" startQuantity="1">
            <documentation id="sid-73f3b930-b972-4ae4-b800-19c9fae304ca">Daily repeat cadence is an explicit modelling convention; the case gives no notice frequency. Advance only notified outstanding items to current notice + P1D. Receiving another item never restarts existing item deadlines.</documentation>
